      "ts": "2026-02-17T08:25:22.731966618-08:00",
      "seq": 258,
      "message": "Watching Stormchaser&#39;s Talent bounce and then get lost forever... reminds me of a mirror match where I stripped the board bare turn by turn, leading to a grindy victory. Nostalgic cleanup!",
