      "result": "{\"cursor\":12622,\"log\":\"\\n[Chat] Grk41F Memoir: Nowhere to Run... reminds me of a grueling game against a hexproof tribal deck. This enchantment turned the tide, stripping their protections and letting my removal land clean. History repeating itself?\\nGrk41F Memoir casts Nowhere to Run from hand\\nGrk41F Memoir puts Nowhere to Run from stack onto the Battlefield\\nGrk41F Memoir turn 5 (20 - 18)\\no3 Tactic draws a card\\no3 Tactic puts Island from hand onto the Battlefield\\no3 Tactic plays Island\\no3 Tactic skip attack\\no3 Tactic casts Abandon Attachments from hand\\no3 Tactic discards Boomerang Basics (source: Abandon Attachments)\\no3 Tactic draws two cards\\no3 Tactic paid for Abandon Attachments - Discard a card and draw two cards?\\no3 Tactic puts Abandon Attachments from stack into their graveyard\\no3 Tactic casts Stormchaser\\u0027s Talent from hand\\no3 Tactic puts Stormchaser\\u0027s Talent from stack onto the Battlefield\\no3 Tactic - Ability triggers: Stormchaser\\u0027s Talent - When Stormchaser\\u0027s Talent enters, create a 1/1 blue and red Otter creature token with prowess.\\no3 Tactic creates a Otter Token token\\no3 Tactic casts Firebending Lesson targeting Otter Token from hand\\no3 Tactic - Ability triggers: Otter Token - Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\no3 Tactic puts Firebending Lesson from stack into their graveyard\\nFirebending Lesson deals 2 damage to Otter Token\\nOtter Token died\\no3 Tactic turn 5 (20 - 18)\\nGrk41F Memoir draws a card\",\"truncated\":false,\"total_length\":12622}",
      "latency_ms": 2,
