      "ts": "2026-02-17T08:25:30.355-08:00",
      "player": "Grk41F Memoir",
      "type": "tool_call",
      "tool": "get_game_log",
      "args": {
        "cursor": 12622,
      },
      "result": "{\"cursor\":15782,\"log\":\"\\n[Chat] Grk41F Memoir: Boomerang Basics... oh, this spell brings back memories of a pivotal game where bouncing an opponent\\u0026#39;s key enchantment bought me three crucial turns to assemble my board. Let\\u0026#39;s see if it disrupts your plans again.\\nGrk41F Memoir casts Boomerang Basics targeting Stormchaser\\u0027s Talent from hand\\n[Chat] Grk41F Memoir: Get Lost... this instant saved me in a game where an opponent\\u0026#39;s persistent enchantment was churning out threats endlessly. One zap, and the pressure vanished. Feels familiar!\\nGrk41F Memoir casts Get Lost targeting Stormchaser\\u0027s Talent from hand\\nStormchaser\\u0027s Talent was destroyed by Get Lost\\no3 Tactic creates a Map Token token\\no3 Tactic creates a Map Token token\\nGrk41F Memoir puts Get Lost from stack into their graveyard\\nBoomerang Basics has been fizzled.\\nGrk41F Memoir puts Boomerang Basics from stack into their graveyard\\nGrk41F Memoir skip attack\\nGrk41F Memoir turn 6 (20 - 18)\\no3 Tactic draws a card\\no3 Tactic skip attack\\no3 Tactic puts Steam Vents from hand onto the Battlefield\\no3 Tactic loses 2 life from Steam Vents\\no3 Tactic plays Steam Vents\\no3 Tactic casts Gran-Gran from hand\\no3 Tactic puts Gran-Gran from stack onto the Battlefield\\no3 Tactic turn 6 (18 - 18)\\nGrk41F Memoir draws a card\\n[Chat] Grk41F Memoir: Watching Stormchaser\\u0026#39;s Talent bounce and then get lost forever... reminds me of a mirror match where I stripped the board bare turn by turn, leading to a grindy victory. Nostalgic cleanup!\",\"truncated\":false,\"total_length\":15782}",
      "latency_ms": 2,
    },
