      "result": "{\"cursor\":26630,\"since_player\":\"Grk41F Memoir\",\"log\":\"Grk41F Memoir turn 8 (18 - 16)\\no3 Tactic draws a card\\n[Chat] Grk41F Memoir: Holding back in combat this turn... reminds me of a cautious game where I waited out summoning sickness on key threats, striking decisively the following turn to overwhelm a wide board. Patience paying dividends as always.\\no3 Tactic puts Willowrush Verge from hand onto the Battlefield\\no3 Tactic plays Willowrush Verge\\no3 Tactic attacks Grk41F Memoir with 1 creature\\no3 Tactic - Ability triggers: Gran-Gran - Whenever Gran-Gran becomes tapped, draw a card, then discard a card.\\no3 Tactic draws a card\\no3 Tactic discards Spirebluff Canal (source: Gran-Gran)\\nAttacker: Gran-Gran (1/2) blocked by Spyglass Siren (2/2) \\n[Chat] Grk41F Memoir: Spyglass Siren blocking Gran-Gran... this reminds me of a pivotal block in a regional where my evasive flyer held the line against a pesky early threat, buying time for my ninjas to assemble and turn the tide. Defenses holding strong with nostalgia!\\nSpyglass Siren deals 2 damage to Gran-Gran\\nGran-Gran deals 1 damage to Spyglass Siren\\nGran-Gran died\\no3 Tactic casts Combustion Technique targeting Spyglass Siren from hand\\nCombustion Technique deals 9 damage to Spyglass Siren\\no3 Tactic puts Combustion Technique from stack into their graveyard\\no3 Tactic moves Spyglass Siren from battlefield to the exile zone (source: Combustion Technique)\\no3 Tactic casts Ral, Crackling Wit from hand\\no3 Tactic puts Ral, Crackling Wit from stack onto the Battlefield\\no3 Tactic turn 8 (18 - 16)\\nGrk41F Memoir draws a card\",\"since_turn\":8,\"truncated\":false,\"total_length\":26630}",
