      "result": "{\"stack\":[{\"name\":\"Boomerang Basics\"}],\"action_type\":\"GAME_SELECT\",\"players\":\"o3 Tactic(you,12hp), Grk41F Memoir(16hp)\",\"stop_reason\":\"playable_cards\",\"response_type\":\"select\",\"untapped_lands\":2,\"message\":\"Play instants and activated abilities\",\"action_pending\":true,\"actions_passed\":7,\"has_playable_cards\":true,\"context\":\"T11 Postcombat Main/Postcombat Main (Grk41F Memoir)\",\"recent_chat\":[\"Grk41F Memoir: Attackers locked in on Ral, awaiting blockers... this poised ninja strike against the planeswalker evokes a tender memory from a local challenge where my hexproof Kaito dismantled a similar threat unblocked, loyalty vanishing in a heartfelt nod to those early days of ninja mastery. Shadows poised to strike!\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Kaito +1 for the third emblem on turn 11... this emblem trifecta stirs a reflective glow from a marathon PTQ top 8 where triple Kaito buffs forged ninjas into colossi, overwhelming in a symphony of shadows that remains a cornerstone of my cherished gaming tapestry. Buffs building eternally!\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Kaito +1 securing the third emblem... this loyalty ascent conjures a nostalgic wave from a starlit PTQ finals where triple emblems on Kaito turned my ninjas into behemoths, sweeping the board in a heartfelt symphony of buffs that lingers like a fond embrace from yesteryears. Peaks of power!\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Passing after Kaito\\u0026#39;s emblem cascade to resolve... this mounting trio of buffs transports me back to a twilight Regional Championship where triple Kaito emblems amplified my ninjas into legends, sweeping foes in a heartfelt barrage of memories that still fuels every swing. Layers legendarily laid!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Activating Grim Bauble p18 for surveil 2... this shadowy dig echoes a cozy evening PTQ where saccing a Bauble unveiled key ninjas from the depths, fueling a lethal ninjutsu chain that turned the tides in a warmly remembered surge of grave insight. Graves whispering secrets!\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Passing to resolve Grim Bauble\\u0026#39;s surveil 2... this grave peek revives a cherished local game where saccing a Bauble post-emblem surge revealed ninja bombs, igniting a turn of unrelenting pressure that etched a warm victory in the annals of my nostalgic duels. Depths delving deeply!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Surveil resolving into the shadows... this library glimpse after emblem surge and bauble sac whispers of a rainy afternoon qualifier where digging post-buffs unearthed ninja reinforcements, fueling an unstoppable assault that remains a beacon of reflective triumph in my journey. Visions veiled!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Surveiling Hallowed Fountain to the depths while keeping Stormchaser\\u0026#39;s Talent primed... this precise library trim conjures a misty morning duel where binning a shockland post-Bauble sac surfaced a Talent that discounted my ninja barrage into oblivion, a fondly remembered pivot that swung the match with elegant precision. Peaks perfectly positioned!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Keeping Stormchaser\\u0026#39;s Talent atop after binning the Fountain... this curated library peek after Bauble sac and emblem stack revives a heartfelt FNM finale where positioning a Talent post-surveil discounted my instant barrage into a ninja symphony, sealing victory in nostalgic harmony. Library layered lovingly!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Surveil complete with Talent atop, eyeing combat swing... this library finesse post-Bauble and triple emblems harkens to a fireside FNM where positioning a key Saga after surveil ignited a discount engine mid-pressure, culminating in ninja dominance that warms the soul like embers of old glories. Shadows sharpening for strike!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Passing priority with Kaito towering at 9/10 under triple emblems, primed for combat... this colossal ninja poised for devastation stirs a sun-kissed memory from a Grand Prix day two where a buffed Kaito emblem stack demolished defenses unyielding, carving a path to top tables in a warmly recalled surge of shadowy supremacy. Shadows surging forth!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Casting Boomerang Basics on Artist\\u0026#39;s Talent... this timely bounce of a rising Saga floods back a cherished Pro Tour memory where returning an opponent\\u0026#39;s leveling enchantment mid-main phase derailed their engine, paving the way for my ninjas to overrun unchecked in a heartfelt cascade of disruption and dominance. Echoes eternally bouncing back!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Swinging with the emblem-empowered Kaito into the red zone... this hexproof ninja colossus at peak prowess dredges a golden Pro Tour side event where a triple-buffed Kaito carved through defenses unyielding, dropping foes from 20 to dust in a cascade of fondly remembered loyalty-fueled fury. Ninja unstoppable!\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Confirming the solo Kaito assault through the shadows... this emblem-stacked ninja vanguard evokes a heartfelt dawn patrol FNM where a lone buffed Kaito pierced wide-open lanes, chipping away at life totals in a rhythmic dance of unblockable menace that built to a cherished crescendo of victory. Shadows solitary but supreme!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Passing at declare blockers with Kaito looming unblockable... this poised ninja titan under emblem cascade recalls a balmy beach Regional where a hexproof Kaito evaded chump blocks effortlessly, grinding value turn after turn in a heartfelt rhythm of incremental triumphs that built to a lovingly etched win. Hexproof horizons holding!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Passing at combat damage with Kaito\\u0026#39;s 6 carving deep... this emblem-amplified strike dropping to 12hp echoes a crisp autumn PTQ where a buffed Kaito\\u0026#39;s unblocked swings methodically dismantled a stalled board, each chunk a heartfelt step toward triumph in memories that glow like fallen leaves. Ninja nipping relentlessly!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Unleashing Boomerang Basics to bounce Artist\\u0026#39;s Talent back to hand... this disruptive return of their discount engine conjures a cozy winter SCG Open where resetting an opponent\\u0026#39;s leveling Saga mid-late game stalled their burn barrage, allowing my ninjas to reclaim control in a warmly recalled tale of timely tempo swings. Talent temporarily tamed!\\n\",\"Grk41F Memoir: Targeting Artist\\u0026#39;s Talent with Boomerang Basics for the bounce... this pivotal return of their Saga engine stirs a nostalgic eve of Regionals where resetting an opponent\\u0026#39;s cantrip machine mid-game gifted me breathing room for ninjutsu recursion, unfolding into a tapestry of treasured tactical mastery. Saga sent sailing home!\\n\"],\"respond_with\":\"id\\u003d\\\"pN\\\" or index\\u003dN to play, or answer\\u003dfalse to pass\",\"choices\":[{\"mana_cost\":\"{1}{U}\",\"name\":\"It\\u0027ll Quench Ya!\",\"index\":0,\"action\":\"cast\",\"id\":\"p40\"}]}",
